   "widgets_values": [
    "Units are physical. `far_parallax_pct 0.25` = 9.6 px max behind screen at 3840 (22 m child-eye ceiling). `near_parallax_pct 1.0` = 38.4 px max in front.\n`convergence 0.35` = depth value on the screen plane — constant for the shot. `hull_px 1` = silhouette hull (see `depth_hull`).\n`background_pushpull` = paint-in seeded from background only. `symmetric` = both eyes ±½ parallax. SBS is **left-first**.\n\nTune order: polarity → convergence (so the bank/figures sit where you want relative to screen) → budgets (report.ok) → hull/fill on the anaglyph."
   ],
   "title": "STEREO — settings"
  }
